<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta content='text/html; charset=UTF-8' http-equiv='Content-Type' />
  </head>
  <body>
    <h2>Welcome to Memverse, <%= @user.name || @user.login %>!</h2>
    
    <p>We noticed you haven't started memorizing Bible verses yet. Memverse makes it easy and enjoyable to memorize Scripture!</p>
    
    <h3>Getting Started is Easy:</h3>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Choose your Bible translation</strong> - Pick the version you're most comfortable with</li>
      <li><strong>Add your first verse</strong> - Start with something meaningful to you</li>
      <li><strong>Review daily</strong> - Just 5 minutes a day can make a big difference</li>
    </ol>
    
    <p style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
      <%= link_to "Start Memorizing Now", add_verse_url, 
                  style: "background-color: #4CAF50; color: white; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block;" %>
    </p>
    
    <h3>Why Memorize Scripture?</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Hide God's word in your heart (Psalm 119:11)</li>
      <li>Be ready to give an answer (1 Peter 3:15)</li>
      <li>Renew your mind (Romans 12:2)</li>
    </ul>
    
    <p>Join thousands of believers who are memorizing Scripture together. Our spaced repetition system makes memorization easier and more effective.</p>
    
    <p>If you have any questions, feel free to <%= link_to "contact us", contact_url %>.</p>
    
    <p>
      Blessings,<br>
      The Memverse Team
    </p>
    
    <hr style="margin-top: 40px; border: 1px solid #eee;">
    <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #666;">
      You're receiving this email because you signed up for Memverse. 
      <%= link_to "Update your email preferences", update_profile_url %> or 
      <%= link_to "unsubscribe", update_profile_url %>.
    </p>
  </body>
</html>